  - elementId: lbody
    elementType: text
    bounds: [26, 118, 270, 300]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      text: |
        <p>粉笔以钝角推画黑板，连续运动却留下周期性虚线——IPT 2023 赛题「The Chalk Trick」（Walter Lewin 演示）。</p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">定量目标：产出可预测虚线参数</p>
        <p><span style="color:$blue">间距 p · 虚长 s · 间隙 g · 线宽 w</span></p>
        <p style="margin-top:10px">关键变量：交接状态 (N₀, ω₀)、倾角 α、速度 v、粉笔半径 R。</p>
  - elementId: frameA
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [330, 86, 604, 128]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$graybg"}
  - elementId: frameAhead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [350, 98, 560, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 13
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
