  - elementId: frameAbody
    elementType: text
    bounds: [350, 122, 566, 84]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      lineHeight: 1.55
      text: |
        <p><strong>A</strong>　复现与条件　　<strong>B</strong>　参数辨识（无量纲判据）</p>
        <p><strong>C</strong>　普遍性验证　　<strong>D</strong>　反演检验</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><span style="font-size:12.5px; color:$soft">方案文档按 A–D 逐条定稿，成本、周计划与风险表同步修订。</span></p>
  - elementId: rhead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [330, 240, 400, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      wrap: false
      text: 理论线（T1 → T2 → T3 递进）
  - elementId: rbody
    elementType: text
    bounds: [330, 270, 604, 210]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 14
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: |
        <p><strong>T1</strong>　低维集总模型：弹簧–滑块骨架，最快给出参数依赖</p>
        <p><strong>T2</strong>　连续弹性梁：Euler–Bernoulli 梁 + 板面接触</p>
        <p><strong>T3</strong>　进阶理论：率态摩擦 · 稳定性 · 分岔 · 相图 · 磨损 · 无量纲化</p>
        <p style="margin-top:8px"><span style="font-size:13px; color:$soft">T3(e) 给出无量纲组</span><span style="font-size:13px">（Δμ、pk/R、v/(d·ω₁) 等）与可检验预言；磨耗沉积按 Archard 型磨耗律建模，板面分布经相对位移映射、多次覆盖折叠求和。</span></p>
  - elementId: cite
    elementType: text
    bounds: [26, 512, 908, 16]
    content:
